  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3002\n\u6B21\u306E\u5546\u54C1\u3082\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u306D\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So with that being said...\nLet\u0027s work on the next batch of items together, Ryza."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3001\u697D\u3057\u3044\u6642\u9593\u304C\u7D42\u308F\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u307E\u305F\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u5192\u967A\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, I\u0027m glad these wonderful times aren\u0027t coming to an end.\nWe can still go on adventures together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305A\u3063\u3068\u2026\u2026\u305A\u3063\u3068\u3053\u3093\u306A\u6642\u9593\u304C\u7D9A\u3051\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306E\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wish... I wish these moments could last forever..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3093\u306A\u308F\u3051\u306B\u3082\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3044\u306E\u306F\u3001\u5206\u304B\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u306E\u3084\u308B\u3079\u304D\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308B\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Though I know that\u0027s not possible.\nWe each have our own paths to follow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306D\u3048\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u3002\u7D04\u675F\u3057\u3088\u3046\uFF1F\n\u6765\u5E74\u3082\u307E\u305F\u3001\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u8D08\u308A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u3057\u5408\u3046\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Ryza. Shall we make a promise?\nTo exchange gifts again next year, just like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u7D04\u675F\u304C\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3053\u306B\u3044\u305F\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u611F\u3058\u3089\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As long as we have that promise, I\u0027ll be able to feel close to you,\nno matter where we are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u6307\u5207\u308A\u3057\u3088\u3046\uFF1F\n\u5618\u3064\u3044\u305F\u3089\u3001\u8A31\u3055\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3093\u3066\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, shall we pinky swear?\nAnd if you break it, I won\u0027t forgive you... Just kidding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
